      ]
    },
    "validation": {
      "summary": "make runtime-check passed (ruff, mypy, contracts, 1,377 tests including 6 new). Governance checks foundation, model-tests and point-in-time exited 0. Two deliberate breaks each fail a test. Real-data audit (read only): 2025 week 10 at each kickoff and 2026 week 12 at the run build with every feature fully covered, about 5 s per week. Not exercised: any fitted model, backtest or service.",
